        "text": "🚨 Our Generative AI Lab is releasing Primer: an agent-driven system where a teacher talks through lessons &amp; gets back a playable simulation for their students, grounded in pedagogy. We hope educators &amp; researchers build on it. Paper/prompts/code are open: https://t.co/ltSbgjTeGp https://t.co/pbit5AK1tm"
      },
