            "id": "2121001771103334743",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We believe that AI, when used properly, can have a large positive impact on education, but the major AIs are not built for learning out-of-the-box. We wanted to make sure we gave control to educators so they can make choices. \n\n(Yes, it is named after the Primer from Diamond Age)"
      }
